ally care about is making progressive  web applications better and more  powerful and so all of the work that  we've done on angular Universal is being  used here for things like rendering an  app shell figuring out which routes  exists in the application and so this is  all available today under ng pw8 tools  and the last thing that I really just  recommend you do to leave you with here  is just go ahead and take a look at the  angular Universal project we've got  excellent steps for getting started here  at bit ly slash universal dash CLI and  hopefully that will give everyone a big  kickstart thank you so much for having  me  [Applause]
 

